WEBVTT

00:00:00.692 --> 00:00:02.730
<v><b>Female Speaker 1:</b></v> I usually <b>work</b> at home.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.954
<v><b>Female Speaker 2:</b></v> My parents <b>don’t live</b> near here.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.384
<v><b>Female Speaker 3:</b></v> <b>Do</b> you <b>speak</b> French?

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:16.161
<v><b>Female Speaker 2:</b></v> Yes, we <b>do</b>. / No, we <b>don’t</b>.

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:20.590
<v><b>Male Speaker 1:</b></v> My brother <b>works</b> in the city centre.

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:24.251
<v><b>Male Speaker 2:</b></v> It <b>doesn’t</b> often rain here.

00:00:26.273 --> 00:00:27.758
<b>Does</b> she like pop music?

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.085
<v><b>Male Speaker 3:</b></v> Yes, she <b>does</b>.

00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:33.493
No, she <b>doesn’t</b>.